 -1*10 = -10\nSum = 5+15+10-10 = 20. f(5) = 20/32 = 5/8.\n\nn=7: (n+1)/2 = 4. Sum i=0 to 4.\n- i=0: 7*C(7,0) = 7\n- i=1: 5*C(7,1) = 5*7 = 35\n- i=2: 3*C(7,2) = 3*21 = 63\n- i=3: 1*C(7,3) = 1*35 = 35\n- i=4: (-1)*C(7,4) = -1*35 = -35\nSum = 7+35+63+35-35 = 105. f(7) = 105/128.\n\nTotal = 0 + 3/8 + 5/8 + 105/128 = 3/8 + 5/8 + 105/128 = 8/8 + 105/128 = 1 + 105/128 = 128/128 + 105/128 = 233/128.\n\nLet me double check. 3/8 + 5/8 = 8/8 = 1. 1 + 105/128 = 233/128.\n\n233/128 = 1.8203125.\n\nLet me verify f(7) sum: 7+35 = 42, +63 = 105, +35 = 140, -35 = 105. Yes 105.\n\nSo the answer is 233/128.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1786705415}
